<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Marshalls lifts half-year earnings.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Marshalls lifts half-year earnings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, (cts)		22.4	  vs 19.9</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 17.0	  vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.90	  vs 1.69</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.09	  vs 2.79</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.19	  vs 1.10</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.50	  vs 1.54</p>
<p>    Sales &amp; commission    1.54	  vs 1.79</p>
<p>    Rental income	   8.44	  vs 7.77</p>
<p>    Turnover		  9.98	  vs 9.55</p>
<p>Div payable August 15</p>
<p>on register August 1</p>
<p>Full name: Marshalls Ltd (property)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
